{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"“拓扑 Hochschild 同调”"},1],"taxon":[{"Plain":"Wiki. "},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"拓扑 Hochschild 同调"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>设 $R$ 为 "},{"Local":{"url":"E∞-环","text":"E∞-环"}},{"Plain":", $R \\to\\mathrm {THH}(R):= R^{\\otimes S^1}$ 是 $R$ 到 $S^1$-作用的 "},{"Local":{"url":"E∞-环","text":"E∞-环"}},{"Plain":"的万有态射, 也即 $R\\colon *\\to \\mathsf {CAlg}(\\mathsf {Sp})$ 沿 $*\\to BS^1$ 的左 Kan 扩张.</p>\n<p>由于 $S^1=*\\sqcup_{*\\sqcup *}*$, $\\mathrm {THH}(R)$ 有如下具体表达式,\n$$\r\n\\mathrm {THH}(R) = R\\otimes_{R\\otimes R}R.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>与 K-理论的关系</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>THH and TC are in practice computationally useful approximations to K</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>[Hochschild (上)同调](Hochschild (上)同调.md)</p>\n"}]}}